  "ai4mars-dataset-merged-0.6/mer/labels/train/NOTE.txt": "Each label is named <basename>_merged#.png, where <basename> corresponds to the image filename, and # corresponds to the number of labels the single merged label was sourced from using a 2/3 agreement metric and a minimum of 3 labelers per image. Pixels not meeting the 2/3 agreement metric are left as NULL, and images that do not have at least 3 labels are skipped.",
  "ai4mars-dataset-merged-0.6/mer/NOTE.txt": "Opportunity filename prefix: 1\nSpirit filename prefix: 2\n",
  "ai4mars-dataset-merged-0.6/msl/ncam/labels/test/NOTE.txt": "min1, min2, min3 agree refer to the algorithm used to merge test labels. For example, for min2-100agree, semantic labeled pixels are only included if at least 2 out of the 3 expert labelers agreed on those pixels.",
  "ai4mars-dataset-merged-0.6/msl/NOTE.txt": "mcam: mastcam, color images; used for science and rover operator understanding. Generally does not include range data\r\nncam: navcam, grayscale images; stereo imagery the rover uses to drive",
